1248:			;***********************************************************
1249:			; EXCHANGE ROUTINE
1250:			;***********************************************************
1251:			; FUNCTION:   --  To determine the exchange value of a
1252:			;                 piece on a given square by examining all
1253:			;                 attackers and defenders of that piece.
1254:			;
1255:			; CALLED BY:  --  POINTS
