2036:			;*******************************************************
2037:			; GRAPHICS DATA BASE
2038:			;*******************************************************
2039:			; DESCRIPTION:  The Graphics Data Base contains the
2040:			;               necessary stored data to produce the piece
2041:			;               on the board. Only the center 4 x 4 blocks are
2042:			;               stored and only for a Black Piece on a White
2043:			;               square. A White piece on a black square is
2044:			;               produced by complementing each block, and a
2045:			;               piece on its own color square is produced
2046:			;               by moving in a kernel of 6 blocks.
2047:			;*******************************************************
2048:	0180          	        ORG     START+384
2049:	0200          	BLBASE  EQU     START+512
2050:	FF80          	BLOCK   EQU     $-BLBASE
